<v Rob Levine>Oh yeah. Oh yeah, completely. I mean, he was a sort of larger-than-life figure. At that point, he smoked big Cuban cigars, which we'd have to get for him. It was sort of contraband, and we had to get them from Cuba.
<v Rob Levine>哦是的。哦是的，完全是。我的意思是，他是一个某种程度上超越现实的人物。当时，他抽大雪茄，我们必须为他弄到。这是一种走私品，我们必须从古巴弄到。

